option "title" "Counterparty Fixture"
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

2026-01-01 open Assets:Bank:ZSYH
2026-01-01 open Assets:Receivables:Lend
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Food

; posting 级 metadata——ADR 23 主用法（「人」挂在往来类账户的分录上）
2026-05-19 * "李素珍" "转账汇款"
  Assets:Receivables:Lend  20000.00 CNY
    counterparty: "李素珍"
  Assets:Bank:ZSYH  -20000.00 CNY

; transaction 级 metadata——回退路径（手工编辑 / 导入 / 历史数据）
2026-05-22 * "微信转账" "快捷支付"
  counterparty: "李志全"
  Assets:Receivables:Lend  5000.00 CNY
  Assets:Bank:ZSYH  -5000.00 CNY

; 无 counterparty——非往来类交易，索引该列为 null
2026-06-01 * "超市" "买菜"
  Expenses:Food  30.00 CNY
  Assets:Bank:ZSYH  -30.00 CNY
